WEBVTT

00:08.390 --> 00:10.550
AozoraSubs and TMUsubs  present

00:11.000 --> 00:15.390
Daa! Daa! Daa!

00:11.310 --> 00:15.180
Mukai awase ni suwatta shunkan ni

00:11.310 --> 00:15.180
The moment we sat facing each other

00:15.650 --> 00:19.970
otona no yokogao ni DOKI DOKI shiteru no

00:15.650 --> 00:19.970
my heart was thumping at the sideways view of your adult-like face

00:20.320 --> 00:24.060
Itsudemo soba ni iru hazu demo

00:20.320 --> 00:24.060
Although you're always beside me

00:24.360 --> 00:28.730
hontou wa KIMI no koto yoku shiranai yo ne

00:24.360 --> 00:28.730
the truth is I don't really know much about you

00:28.910 --> 00:37.450
Itsumo nakamatachi to asonderu kedo

00:28.910 --> 00:37.450
We're always playing with our friends

00:37.630 --> 00:43.290
futarikiri ni naru to doko ka chigau yo

00:37.630 --> 00:43.290
but when we're alone, something's different

00:43.880 --> 00:46.830
Nanika hanashi kakete

00:43.880 --> 00:46.830
Talk to me about something

00:47.550 --> 00:51.960
Zutto dare yori mo daisuki da yo

00:47.550 --> 00:51.960
I've always loved you more than anyone else

00:52.020 --> 00:56.300
dakedo ienai yo chikasugiru yo

00:52.020 --> 00:56.300
but I can't say it, you're too close

00:56.440 --> 01:00.430
Itsuka kizuite yo mitsumeteru yo

00:56.440 --> 01:00.430
Someday, notice I'm gazing at you

01:00.440 --> 01:04.890
Koi no TANE wo maitara

01:00.440 --> 01:04.890
When we plant the seeds of love

01:05.030 --> 01:09.150
hora sakasou yo ippai

01:05.030 --> 01:09.150
see, they will all bloom fully

01:09.530 --> 01:14.950
Mou kamisama ni onegai

01:09.530 --> 01:14.950
That's my wish to God

01:21.050 --> 01:23.140
Is it really magic?

01:23.930 --> 01:25.260
Pepo

01:25.260 --> 01:28.540
That thing with long ears… it can fly?

01:37.070 --> 01:42.080
On the Night of the Full Moon

01:47.540 --> 01:51.090
A message from the rescue shuttle came just now.

01:53.590 --> 01:56.970
They will be arriving on the night of the next full moon.

01:59.070 --> 02:00.180
Full moon…

02:00.930 --> 02:03.810
The day after tomorrow is the full moon.

02:16.110 --> 02:18.060
Huh? What’s that?

02:18.060 --> 02:21.030
What on earth-? It’s a holiday today.

02:21.030 --> 02:22.230
Yes?

02:26.540 --> 02:28.820
What- did something happen?

02:28.820 --> 02:31.380
Have you heard? The date of the launch has been finally decided.

02:31.840 --> 02:33.260
Where’s Miyu-san?

02:33.260 --> 02:34.240
The launch…

02:34.240 --> 02:35.140
Please say a few words-.

02:35.140 --> 02:36.300
Miyu-san! Miyu-san!

02:36.300 --> 02:38.610
It’s finally decided. Please tell us how you feel-

02:38.610 --> 02:39.330
What is it?

02:39.330 --> 02:42.050
The shuttle’s launch is scheduled for early morning!

02:42.050 --> 02:45.920
Yes, I feel like I’ve been waiting for this for a long time.

02:45.920 --> 02:48.060
Was it a sudden decision?

02:48.060 --> 02:51.060
We’ve been preparing for months,

02:51.060 --> 02:55.980
waiting patiently for this day.

02:56.470 --> 02:59.990
Do you have any message for your family and people in Japan?

02:59.990 --> 03:00.720
Yes.

03:01.220 --> 03:06.330
It’s been my dream since childhood, and it’s finally come true!
I’m really looking forward to traveling in space.

03:06.330 --> 03:11.960
Miyu, I’m off. When I return, we’ll talk to our heart’s content about space and other stuff.

03:11.960 --> 03:13.220
See you!

03:13.710 --> 03:15.000
Tomorrow…?

03:15.000 --> 03:17.370
Hurry up and go, Mom!

03:17.370 --> 03:18.920
Hey, Miyu…

03:18.920 --> 03:23.640
Those guys want you to speak to them.
So go say something already.

03:28.020 --> 03:30.270
Well, of course I’m worried.

03:30.270 --> 03:35.270
But it’s great that she’s able to fulfill her childhood dream.

03:35.270 --> 03:40.120
To think that she was able to hold onto it for so long…

03:40.120 --> 03:42.410
It's wonderful, isn't it?

03:40.540 --> 03:41.380
Miyu-chan…!

03:42.780 --> 03:44.830
Don’t you feel lonely being away from your parents?

03:44.830 --> 03:46.330
Oh, not at all.

03:46.330 --> 03:47.360
Why is that?

03:47.360 --> 03:51.710
It’s more like I don’t have time to feel lonely. Every day is hectic.

03:51.710 --> 03:54.310
Miyu-chan's on T.V.!

03:54.310 --> 03:55.420
I know, right!

03:55.420 --> 03:58.650
At present I’m staying here at the Saionji’s.

03:58.650 --> 04:01.880
There’s uncle and Kanata-kun and Ruu-kun..

04:01.880 --> 04:05.130
How wonderful….

04:02.050 --> 04:11.630
And Ayaka-chan, Nanami-chan, Chris-chan, Santa-san, Momoka-chan, Mikan-san and Wannya. And Many more wonderful friends.

04:05.200 --> 04:08.900
Kanata’s on TV…how wonderful…

04:09.280 --> 04:12.310
She mentioned me! Thank you, Koizuki-san!

04:11.630 --> 04:14.560
Every day is fun!

04:12.310 --> 04:14.560
I’ll go and congratulate her!

04:19.120 --> 04:20.820
Silence

04:20.820 --> 04:24.420
Phew! What a stressful morning!

04:24.420 --> 04:27.280
I'll say. Well, time to eat.

04:28.370 --> 04:30.550
Oh, it’s pumpkin.

04:30.550 --> 04:31.330
Yes

04:32.300 --> 04:34.480
I heard! I heard!

04:34.480 --> 04:35.250
Wannya!

04:35.250 --> 04:41.070
With this and that, and the other things...

04:36.860 --> 04:38.110
What is it, Mikan-san?

04:38.110 --> 04:39.420
What happened?

04:41.270 --> 04:44.880
I see. I suppose there’s a certain charm to it…

04:44.910 --> 04:48.380
Though it’s a bit dark….

04:48.380 --> 04:51.240
Okay, I’ve decided. If I take the workroom-

04:51.240 --> 04:51.730
Huh?

04:51.730 --> 04:53.730
I guess there’s no objection?

04:53.730 --> 04:57.210
Oh, wait- will Houshou-san use it once he gets back?

04:57.210 --> 05:00.360
But it’s pretty big, so maybe we can partition it-

05:00.360 --> 05:02.780
Mikan-san…Is my dad coming back?

05:02.780 --> 05:07.050
He is. I got a call last night, saying he’s coming back.

05:07.050 --> 05:12.540
He mentioned something about the apartment being too small and moving to a bigger place as soon as possible…

05:13.390 --> 05:19.250
Well, my room will be next to Kanata-kun’s.
Let’s get everything settled right away.

05:19.250 --> 05:24.360
Hey! We have to get it settled. And we have time today-

05:24.360 --> 05:26.660
We’re facing a deadline.

05:26.660 --> 05:28.470
Sorry, Mikan-san

05:28.470 --> 05:32.530
Deadline? Oh, I see. Must be homework piled up.

05:32.530 --> 05:36.480
If that’s the case, I'll just go and visit someone else.

05:39.110 --> 05:40.440
Hm…

05:40.440 --> 05:45.400
To tell or not to tell…
that is the question.

05:45.400 --> 05:48.450
Ah! What am I going to do!

05:48.450 --> 05:50.280
Mama! Papa!

05:52.100 --> 05:56.690
Even so, ever since I learned of this, I’ve been in a state of shock.

05:56.690 --> 05:59.500
That it was kept a secret till now is really shocking.

05:59.500 --> 06:03.090
Maybe such things are common in this town?

06:03.090 --> 06:05.090
Phew…! Let’s go home.

06:05.090 --> 06:08.020
It’s not nice to butt in, right?

06:09.930 --> 06:14.720
Aaah…but it’s bothering me so much I can’t leave it alone!

06:18.350 --> 06:20.920
Oh! Kurosu-kun.

06:20.920 --> 06:23.240
What were you doing just now?

06:23.240 --> 06:25.400
What was <i>I</i> doing?

06:25.400 --> 06:29.050
You were the one acting strange.

06:29.050 --> 06:33.780
Er..um..Kurosu-kun…Actually….

06:35.870 --> 06:40.110
That’s what I saw. Maybe I didn't see everything clearly…

06:40.110 --> 06:44.090
What the heck! What was that!?

06:45.090 --> 06:49.180
So, that’s it. We don’t have much time.

06:49.180 --> 06:52.950
Yeah. We have to talk to Ruu-kun.

06:52.950 --> 06:54.470
Momoka-chan too.

06:54.470 --> 06:56.880
What did you want to talk to me about?

06:56.880 --> 06:58.880
You were here, Momoka-chan?

06:58.880 --> 06:59.590
I was here.

06:59.590 --> 07:05.360
It’s nothing. Nothing at all. Ruu-kun, hurry up. Momoka-chan’s here.

07:07.070 --> 07:08.780
Ruu!

07:13.530 --> 07:17.250
What are we going to say to her...

07:17.250 --> 07:18.020
Yeah

07:18.020 --> 07:21.760
They’re so close to each other…

07:25.970 --> 07:28.460
Shall we all go to Momonland?

07:28.460 --> 07:28.910
Really?

07:28.910 --> 07:32.860
Since we’re free today, let’s go. How about it, Momoka-chan?

07:33.400 --> 07:35.780
Okay! Let me call Mom.

07:35.780 --> 07:36.720
<i>Yay!</i>

07:37.070 --> 07:38.910
Hello, it’s me.

07:38.230 --> 07:39.840
We’ll talk there.

07:39.090 --> 07:43.150
I got invited out to Momonland...

07:42.010 --> 07:47.150
That’s right. Let’s get together with everyone for one last time and have some beautiful memories…

07:43.150 --> 07:47.150
so I'm not going to be home for awhile is that okay?

07:47.910 --> 07:48.650
Huh?

07:48.650 --> 07:51.490
It’s true. I saw it with my own eyes.

07:51.490 --> 07:55.970
Ruu-kun was floating and then Mitarashi-san who’s most likely his brother,

07:55.970 --> 08:00.610
transformed just like that into this weird creature….

08:00.610 --> 08:05.260
It’s okay if you don’t believe me. It’s fine…

08:05.260 --> 08:06.540
Wow!

08:06.540 --> 08:11.510
Maybe those two are aliens. If that’s so, that’s great!

08:11.510 --> 08:16.140
I mean, I met aliens! How incredible is that!

08:16.140 --> 08:19.750
Hm…I don’t know whether they’re aliens or not…

08:19.750 --> 08:20.980
Who's an alien?

08:20.980 --> 08:24.180
That would be Ruu-kun and Mitarashi-san, but I don't know-

08:24.180 --> 08:26.940
Wha- when did you guys get here?

08:26.940 --> 08:27.730
Just now.

08:27.730 --> 08:31.440
I saw Miyu-chan’s interview on TV and came to congratulate her.

08:31.440 --> 08:34.170
On the way I bumped into Nanami-chan and-

08:34.170 --> 08:36.120
Well, we couldn’t keep quiet after hearing that.

08:36.120 --> 08:37.060
So, what about aliens?

08:37.060 --> 08:39.160
Isn’t that great! Isn’t that great!

08:41.370 --> 08:42.900
Why are we hiding?

08:42.900 --> 08:47.200
Shh! Look! Look! Mitarashi-san is most likely his brother.

08:48.290 --> 08:52.260
Momonland

08:52.260 --> 08:55.870
Ruu, let’s get on that!

08:56.260 --> 08:58.780
Momoka-san, please don’t get too exited.

08:58.780 --> 09:00.720
Of course I won’t. Stupid Wannya!

09:01.180 --> 09:04.960
Hehehe- even with these on, we can still follow them…

09:04.960 --> 09:06.670
or not.

09:06.670 --> 09:11.570
I still can’t believe it! Is Mitarashi-san really his brother!?

09:11.570 --> 09:16.610
But speaking of strange white creatures, we’ve seen that stuffed toy before, remember?

09:16.610 --> 09:18.640
Maybe it’s a robot from NASA?

09:18.640 --> 09:20.880
If they’re really alive…

09:20.880 --> 09:28.510
Ha ha ha, don’t be silly. If Ruu-kun and Mitarashi-san who’s his brother are aliens, then that makes Kanata-kun also an alien.

09:28.510 --> 09:36.160
In that case, he would have seen right into what was in my heart till now.

09:36.160 --> 09:45.010
"Chris, I understand your feelings. Oh my honey!’"
ohhhh! I want that to happen!!

09:45.010 --> 09:46.850
One way or the other, this girl….

09:46.850 --> 09:49.600
It’s nothing like that. Everything’s fine.

09:49.600 --> 09:52.740
Maybe it was trick of light or you were dreaming…

09:52.740 --> 09:56.900
Dream…? That’s right. I’m always dreaming.

09:56.900 --> 10:00.370
I see, Then does this mean you want to hear about my dreams?

10:00.370 --> 10:01.490
He’s hopeless…

10:03.040 --> 10:07.580
No, it wasn’t a dream. I definitely saw it. You’ll see.

10:07.580 --> 10:08.540
Please wait.

10:09.260 --> 10:11.750
Let’s go back to the beginning!

10:16.180 --> 10:18.050
Stop! Stop!

10:19.590 --> 10:22.560
I said stop!

10:27.780 --> 10:29.460
Isn’t this fun!

10:29.460 --> 10:31.440
Why me?

10:31.440 --> 10:33.110
Ferris Wheel

10:34.380 --> 10:36.190
This is so exciting, Ruu!

10:37.210 --> 10:38.600
They got in.

10:39.390 --> 10:42.210
Can you tell me whats going on here!

10:42.210 --> 10:42.960
Chris-chan!

10:42.960 --> 10:44.330
Right! Let’s go after them!

10:44.330 --> 10:46.930
Miyu-chan and the others are being their usual selves.

10:46.930 --> 10:48.910
They seem to be getting along well like always

10:48.910 --> 10:52.530
so they are going to ride the ferris wheel together...

10:52.530 --> 10:54.630
Ah, I'm going to die!

10:54.930 --> 10:58.190
That’s strange...and weird…totally bizarre…

10:58.190 --> 10:59.750
Are you going to get in?

10:59.750 --> 11:02.550
Oh, of course! Come on, everybody.

11:03.820 --> 11:08.980
Uwaa! Look, Ruu! Everything looks so tiny.

11:10.190 --> 11:13.950
We can’t see our house from here.

11:17.330 --> 11:18.900
Momoka-chan, Ruu-kun…

11:22.540 --> 11:23.740
What is it?

11:25.110 --> 11:29.910
There’s something important that we have to tell you both.

11:42.700 --> 11:44.390
We won’t be seen in these.

11:44.390 --> 11:47.500
But Miyu-chan and the others don’t look too good.

11:47.500 --> 11:48.640
We're clearly visible.

11:48.910 --> 11:51.850
It’s fine. These are the camouflage heads that I made.

11:51.850 --> 11:52.660
Stylish…

11:52.660 --> 11:54.610
Let’s go back.

11:54.610 --> 11:57.360
Miyu-chan’s
group.

11:54.610 --> 11:57.360
Nanami-chan’s
group

11:57.820 --> 11:59.490
Something important?

11:59.890 --> 12:03.990
You know that Ruu’s different from other babies, right?

12:03.990 --> 12:11.730
I know. Ruu can fly, move his toys without touching them…it’s really amazing!

12:12.970 --> 12:16.210
Do you know why he has that kind of power?

12:17.150 --> 12:21.760
Ruu’s different from other babies because he comes from a different planet.

12:22.490 --> 12:23.630
Different planet?

12:23.940 --> 12:28.810
Ruu-kun came from the planet Otto with Wannya.

12:28.810 --> 12:30.260
That’s right.

12:30.260 --> 12:39.230
Ruu-chama and I were out for a walk when we got caught in a time warp and ended up at Saionji-san’s place.

12:39.230 --> 12:44.930
Then we decided to stay here until Ruu-chama’s parents came for us.

12:46.880 --> 12:52.320
That’s why, you know, Ruu-kun and Wannya have to go back to Otto.

12:52.320 --> 12:54.210
Pepo will also go with them.

12:59.020 --> 13:04.030
Is Otto very far off? Will they never come back to Kanata-oniitan’s house?

13:04.030 --> 13:04.820
It’s very far off.

13:04.820 --> 13:08.060
Once they return to Otto, they won’t-

13:09.860 --> 13:13.640
I don’t…understand anything…

13:13.640 --> 13:19.040
but….I don’t want to be separated from Ruu…I don’t….

13:22.810 --> 13:24.710
Hey, is Momoka-chan crying?

13:24.710 --> 13:25.740
What could have happened?

13:28.820 --> 13:31.550
Momo! Momo!

13:32.610 --> 13:37.120
Ruu…I don’t want to be separated from you! I don’t!

13:39.120 --> 13:40.990
Just as I thought…

13:41.950 --> 13:46.150
Ruu-kun’s mother and father are already nearing Earth.

13:46.150 --> 13:51.340
Ruu is also separated from his parents . Poor little guy...

13:51.340 --> 13:55.230
Wouldn’t you be sad if you were separated from your parents, Momoka-chan?

13:56.820 --> 13:59.490
Yes…I would feel sad...

13:59.490 --> 14:04.840
I think Ruu-chama’s parents are also feeling sad and lonely without Ruu-chama.

14:05.880 --> 14:11.950
I thought we’d always be together…

14:11.950 --> 14:16.750
I thought when we grew up we’d go to school together…

14:19.670 --> 14:20.560
Ah!

14:20.560 --> 14:21.950
Hey! Wait!

14:21.950 --> 14:23.390
It’s glowing!

14:24.700 --> 14:25.490
It’s stopped!

14:25.490 --> 14:26.720
Oh no!

14:28.510 --> 14:29.360
Ruu-kun!

14:29.360 --> 14:30.130
Calm down!

14:30.130 --> 14:30.760
Ruu-chama!

14:31.570 --> 14:32.470
You mustn’t do that!

14:33.330 --> 14:35.700
Ruu-chama, please don’t cry.

14:35.700 --> 14:41.740
Momoka-chan always says that boys shouldn’t cry. Neither should girls.

14:42.550 --> 14:46.430
Wannya, you look very big.

14:47.200 --> 14:49.100
I’ll become even bigger.

14:51.560 --> 14:53.050
That’s Wannya for you.

14:53.050 --> 14:55.870
Thank God for his skills!

14:55.870 --> 14:58.280
I'm the best!

14:59.180 --> 15:00.750
So long as no one saw that-

15:03.070 --> 15:04.150
Guys…!

15:07.790 --> 15:12.220
We apologise for the trouble you’re having with the Ferris Wheel.

15:12.220 --> 15:18.680
Saw that

15:12.220 --> 15:18.680
Been seen

15:12.620 --> 15:18.680
The ride will resume soon, so please wait a while longer.

15:21.600 --> 15:23.790
Stare~~~~~~~

15:24.260 --> 15:25.240
Hello?

15:25.970 --> 15:27.710
Um…you saw that?

15:28.700 --> 15:29.490
You did…

15:29.490 --> 15:30.860
We saw that.

15:31.260 --> 15:33.240
Well, I feel somewhat relieved.

15:34.330 --> 15:37.210
We were so tired of keeping it a secret till now….

15:37.210 --> 15:39.580
Whew! I feel refreshed!

15:38.850 --> 15:39.670
I know!

15:39.670 --> 15:40.590
Er…

15:40.590 --> 15:41.410
Are you guys also…

15:41.410 --> 15:43.000
The same as Ruu-kun?

15:43.000 --> 15:44.060
Oh no, not at all.

15:44.060 --> 15:45.040
Nope.

15:45.040 --> 15:48.190
It’s just me, Ruu-chama and Pepo.

15:48.190 --> 15:51.900
But why’s everyone’s here in Momonland?

15:52.560 --> 15:58.720
Oh, that…it all started at the time of the cultural fest when I happened to see Ruu-kun’s magic.

15:58.720 --> 16:06.010
However, I messed it up by telling the others about it even though it was a secret, and then we followed you…

16:06.010 --> 16:10.950
Don’t worry, Nozomu-kun. Now that everyone knows, I feel like it’s a weight off my chest.

16:10.950 --> 16:13.410
By saying that you’ve made me so happy!

16:13.720 --> 16:16.030
Well, shall we continue this at home?

16:18.270 --> 16:19.330
Wannya!

16:19.490 --> 16:23.420
Ho ho ho! It’s a ‘yamaboushi’

16:23.420 --> 16:24.400
Wannya!

16:24.400 --> 16:26.630
I’m your neighbour.

16:27.390 --> 16:29.600
This lady looks very familiar

16:29.600 --> 16:30.770
Next is-

16:30.770 --> 16:31.720
Wannya!

16:32.430 --> 16:33.810
A white whale

16:33.810 --> 16:36.390
The white whale was also Wannya!

16:36.390 --> 16:39.300
Momoka-chan this must be confusing for you.

16:36.390 --> 16:37.750
Wannya!

16:39.300 --> 16:40.100
Transforming

16:39.940 --> 16:41.900
Do you want to be like Wannya?

16:40.100 --> 16:40.990
Wannya!

16:40.990 --> 16:42.990
That’s Miyu-san.

16:41.970 --> 16:43.070
I’m ok.

16:43.070 --> 16:44.350
Wannya stop transforming!

16:44.350 --> 16:48.070
Whoo boy!  A real alien is amazing!

16:48.070 --> 16:52.030
But to think that even Momoka-chan knew and we had no clue at all…

16:52.030 --> 16:54.780
Well, if everyone knew it’d have been a problem

16:54.780 --> 16:56.070
I guess you’re right.

16:56.340 --> 17:00.020
Here’s tea. Anyway, we’re sorry to have kept it a secret till now.

17:00.020 --> 17:00.870
Sorry.

17:00.870 --> 17:06.050
Let me think…the fact that Wannya-san used to transform into Kanata-kun’s father

17:06.050 --> 17:08.590
meant that it was necessary to do so…

17:08.590 --> 17:10.340
Ah…that is…

17:10.340 --> 17:14.980
My dad had to go to India for training around the same time that Miyu came here.

17:14.980 --> 17:17.890
But he’ll be back as soon as his training gets over.

17:17.890 --> 17:21.680
So that means Kanata-kun’s father was absent all this time…

17:21.680 --> 17:24.450
So the old man we used to see whenever we were here-

17:24.450 --> 17:26.540
That was Wannya all along?

17:26.540 --> 17:28.070
Not all the time.

17:28.070 --> 17:33.920
Sometimes it was my real father himself. Oh, and the fact that we’re cousins is also a lie.

17:30.170 --> 17:32.090
But that would mean...

17:33.920 --> 17:34.480
That’s right.

17:34.480 --> 17:34.930
A lie?

17:34.930 --> 17:37.070
Why did you come to Saionji, Miyu-chan?

17:37.420 --> 17:43.290
My mom and Kanata’s mom were childhood friends and I had come here when I was a kid…

17:43.290 --> 17:44.320
I got it!

17:44.320 --> 17:49.740
Even though you’d visited as a child, you’d forgotten all about it and when you were told about Saionji-san of the big house,

17:49.740 --> 17:55.590
you thought it would be a palatial house like Chris-chan’s, but when you saw it you felt cheated and when Saionji-san’s father saw that he said,

17:55.590 --> 17:58.930
“oho, you’re here. Why don’t you have a bath and freshen up first?”

17:58.930 --> 18:03.520
And when you were in the bathroom, Saionji-kun, who was unaware you were inside, came in and you screamed,”Gyaah! Pervert!!”

18:03.520 --> 18:07.670
and that’s how things got all awkward between them…
something like that, right?

18:07.670 --> 18:09.630
Did she see it all?

18:09.630 --> 18:11.910
You’re too sharp, Aya-chan…

18:11.910 --> 18:14.680
Good thing Chris-chan couldn’t hear it.

18:14.680 --> 18:19.410
Well, in the beginning I found it annoying, but…

18:19.730 --> 18:24.550
When Ruu-kun and Wannya came and Pepo too, it felt like we were a family.

18:24.550 --> 18:29.280
With everyone around, it felt so normal…right?

18:29.280 --> 18:30.090
Yeah

18:30.090 --> 18:32.940
Family, huh?

18:35.850 --> 18:45.390
What the heck! This means WAR! This is going to be an all-out war for love!

18:45.390 --> 18:49.240
But before my old man left, he spoke to Mikan-san.

18:49.240 --> 18:52.610
Mikan-san’s always coming and going….it’s her job.

18:52.890 --> 18:54.570
Mikan-san…always coming and going…?

18:54.570 --> 18:57.090
It was like being in a training camp…

18:57.090 --> 19:00.570
That’s right. Taking turns to cook, shop…

19:00.570 --> 19:07.640
I see…how ridiculous of me to think it was war…!

19:07.640 --> 19:11.660
Miyu-san, Kanata-san, we had fun living together, didn’t we?

19:11.660 --> 19:15.420
Even though you both fought a lot…

19:15.420 --> 19:18.970
The ruckus that was caused when Ruu-kun’s secret leaked out…

19:19.240 --> 19:21.890
Visiting various places with everyone...

19:22.210 --> 19:23.670
So much fun…

19:23.670 --> 19:25.150
So much fun…

19:25.150 --> 19:26.310
So much fun…

19:26.310 --> 19:30.450
What’s that? Why does it seem like it’s all about to end?

19:30.450 --> 19:34.400
We won’t tell anyone about Ruu-kun and Wannya.

19:34.400 --> 19:35.880
My lips are sealed!

19:35.880 --> 19:37.930
As if I’d tell anyone!

19:37.930 --> 19:39.500
We’ll help you-

19:39.500 --> 19:41.360
Take care of Ruu-kun and Pepo.

19:42.700 --> 19:49.700
I’ll help with food and sweets…if it’s not a trouble to anyone.

19:49.980 --> 19:51.580
You guys…thank you.

19:51.580 --> 19:55.430
About…that….

19:57.340 --> 20:00.850
He’s sleepy, so I brought him.

20:00.850 --> 20:01.860
Mama

20:12.320 --> 20:13.730
Yaboshi!

20:13.730 --> 20:15.450
Yo! We’re back!

20:15.450 --> 20:16.610
We came back!

20:16.610 --> 20:18.440
Ahaha…Here we are!

20:20.090 --> 20:22.920
Welcome, Seiya-kun, Rui-san, Teru-san.

20:22.920 --> 20:25.960
Looks like they’re panicking, thinking they’ve been found out.

20:25.960 --> 20:30.160
Don't worry, it’s okay. These guys here already know our secret.

20:32.270 --> 20:36.130
You know, Seiya-kun, Rui-san and Teru-san are aliens.

20:36.130 --> 20:37.920
We’re from the planet Sharaku

20:37.920 --> 20:39.060
Let’s meet again.

20:39.060 --> 20:39.980
Pleased to meet you.

20:39.980 --> 20:42.840
Just how careless can these guys be?

20:42.840 --> 20:45.460
What are you guys doing here?

20:45.460 --> 20:47.440
Oh yeah…hey, Wannya!

20:47.440 --> 20:48.210
Yes?

20:48.210 --> 20:52.940
You know that the rescue ship from Otto is nearing Earth.

20:52.940 --> 20:56.040
Yes. I got the report that they were getting closer.

20:56.040 --> 20:58.220
I see. So you’re finally returning to Otto.

20:58.220 --> 20:58.680
Yes.

20:58.680 --> 21:02.480
In that case, let’s have a farewell party.

21:02.920 --> 21:04.890
Farewll party?

21:04.890 --> 21:06.560
Yeah…

21:06.560 --> 21:08.420
Farewell party for whom?

21:08.420 --> 21:12.620
Actually, you see…tomorrow Ruu and the others will be returning to Otto.

21:15.240 --> 21:19.590
You know... Um…

21:19.590 --> 21:25.550
very soon my folks will be returning to Japan and then I’ll be going back to my old town.

21:30.460 --> 21:32.860
I'll show you my famous karate chop!

21:32.860 --> 21:34.530
Do it!

21:35.010 --> 21:35.690
That’s not very good!

21:36.060 --> 21:39.140
For rebels they sure are are idiots.

21:39.140 --> 21:41.490
Aya! You shouldn't say things like that

21:42.000 --> 21:45.550
Miyu-chan, can’t you stay here till graduation?

21:46.110 --> 21:47.070
Sorry

21:47.070 --> 21:51.190
Miyu-chan not being here is like my rival not being here,

21:51.190 --> 21:56.180
and Kanata-kun….but Miyu-chan’s my friend…

21:56.540 --> 22:01.470
That's it! Miyu-chan…the thought of you not being here is unbearable!

22:01.470 --> 22:02.790
Don’t cry, Chris-chan!

22:05.410 --> 22:11.050
Even though we’re going to be separated soon, Ruu’s sleeping soundly. He’s really just a kid…

22:11.050 --> 22:12.630
That’s because he’s a baby.

22:14.690 --> 22:17.310
Ah! It’s a signal from the rescue ship!

22:17.930 --> 22:21.270
Wannya…Wannya…

22:21.640 --> 22:22.930
What’s the matter, Wannya?

22:22.930 --> 22:24.130
Ruu-kun’s mother?

22:24.130 --> 22:27.030
It's a message from Ruu-sama's family

22:27.030 --> 22:31.740
We’ll be nearing soon….close to Saionji…

22:32.420 --> 22:34.550
Oh…it got cut off…

22:34.550 --> 22:35.300
Yaboshi…

22:35.300 --> 22:35.450
Yes?

22:35.760 --> 22:39.420
Just check it out as soon as you can.  With Sharaku’s UFO you should be able to get more details.

22:39.420 --> 22:40.240
Ok

22:40.240 --> 22:41.420
Come on, Teru!

22:44.890 --> 22:45.590
This?

22:46.590 --> 22:49.490
A space-time distortion is developing close to Earth.

22:49.490 --> 22:50.580
It’s pretty big.

22:50.580 --> 22:54.130
Space-time distortion? You mean the thing that caused Ruu-kun to jump from Otto to Earth?

22:54.130 --> 22:54.600
That’s right.

22:54.880 --> 22:56.470
Don’t tell me…the rescue ship …

22:56.470 --> 22:57.520
…Got sucked into it…?

22:57.830 --> 23:01.730
I think right now the rescue ship is caught in the warp.

23:01.730 --> 23:06.070
If the force of the warp could be weakened…

23:06.370 --> 23:08.400
Teru’s working on it.

23:08.400 --> 23:10.060
Don't tell me...

23:10.060 --> 23:11.260
That’s…

23:12.540 --> 23:13.870
Do you hear anything?

23:19.950 --> 23:24.770
Motto tanoshii koto ga

23:19.950 --> 23:24.770
I felt that everyday

23:25.410 --> 23:28.400
afureru mainichi

23:25.410 --> 23:28.400
more fun-filled days

23:29.200 --> 23:33.530
matteru kigashita

23:29.200 --> 23:33.530
were waiting ahead

23:35.380 --> 23:42.880
datte kimi to mata aeta kara

23:35.380 --> 23:42.880
because I was able to meet you again

23:42.970 --> 23:48.700
Nee ima wa aserazu

23:42.970 --> 23:48.700
Hey, don't be in rush now

23:49.890 --> 23:53.260
Yukkuri aruite

23:49.890 --> 23:53.260
Walk slowly

23:53.560 --> 23:57.050
Takusan waratte

23:53.560 --> 23:57.050
Laugh a lot

23:57.320 --> 24:01.390
Soshite nanika wo mitsuketara

23:57.320 --> 24:01.390
And when you find something

24:01.620 --> 24:04.980
daiji ni shiyou

24:01.620 --> 24:04.980
let's cherish it

24:05.450 --> 24:08.650
mata aeta ne

24:05.450 --> 24:08.650
until we meet again

24:09.200 --> 24:14.700
Issho ni iyou

24:09.200 --> 24:14.700
Let's stay together

24:23.270 --> 24:29.900
The End

24:29.900 --> 25:00.000
Next episode

24:29.940 --> 24:31.000
The Outcome

24:30.650 --> 24:33.540
Even though everyone came to know the story of Ruu-kun and the others-

24:33.540 --> 24:34.500
We liked it!

24:34.500 --> 24:35.250
We’ll help out.

24:34.500 --> 24:35.250
Don’t worry!

24:35.250 --> 24:36.320
We’ll take care of Ruu-kun and the others.

24:36.320 --> 24:37.700
Aliens are amazing!

24:37.700 --> 24:39.790
I just love aliens

24:39.790 --> 24:40.580
Just like a kid!

24:40.580 --> 24:43.250
Next week’s episode of Daa! Daa! Daa! – Let’s meet again!

24:43.250 --> 24:47.590
The rescue ship from Otto will also be arriving tomorrow!

24:47.590 --> 24:51.320
On no! The rescue ship is trapped in the warp!

24:52.460 --> 24:54.630
Everyone, let’s get aboard the rescue ship!

24:54.630 --> 24:56.490
Ruu-kun, see you later!

24:56.190 --> 24:58.190
Let’s meet again
